  <div class="cx-glow"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Any complexity</div>
      <h2 style="margin-top:18px">Not just moving-<wbr>average crossovers.</h2>
      <p>A sentence in, an AI-built algo out — the rules behind every entry and exit, backtested across years. From a plain golden cross to a liquidity sweep into an order-block retest, filtered by macro and a z-score. Pick one and watch it compile.</p>
