          <div><div class="t">An algo, not a bot</div><div class="d">You define only the rules that produce your entry and exit levels — nothing else. No fixed volume, no baked-in leverage. That's exactly what makes it an algo, not a bot.</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ef">
          <div class="ef-ic"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9z"/></svg></div>
          <div><div class="t">Live on your own broker or exchange</div><div class="d">Connect your account once. Your algo fires automatically the instant its rules trigger — no chart-watching, no manual orders. Stop trading by hand.</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ef">
          <div class="ef-ic"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 21v-7M4 10V3M12 21v-9M12 8V3M20 21v-5M20 12V3M1 14h6M9 8h6M17 16h6"/></svg></div>
          <div><div class="t">Your risk, your sizing</div><div class="d">Set a leverage per position, or a fixed risk amount for if the price reaches your exit. Either way, AlgoBuild calculates the exact volume for every trade.</div></div>
